    description: "Pass 13: hypergumbo routes /tmp/bm.json -> 'No API routes found in the behavior map.' BUT bm.json.usage_contexts has 8 entries with context_name='Route' from serve.py (e.g., '/health' GET _health, '/api/items' GET _api_list_items). Top-level bm.json keys do NOT include 'routes' (or 'frameworks'). Also: routes subcommand generates 5 sketch artifacts (4k/16k/64k/handler-slice/results) on a read-only operation, similar to U."  # e7c6
    fields:  # e7c6
      statement: "Route data extracted by analyzers is reachable via the hypergumbo routes subcommand."  # e7c6
      root_cause: "Routes are emitted into bm.json.usage_contexts (8 entries with context_name=Route from serve.py) but the routes subcommand reads only the top-level bm.json.routes field, which is never populated; there is no promotion from usage_contexts to routes."  # e7c6
